      "briefing": "*********** People's Alliance ***********\n******/ 'Stronger When United' /******\n\nRE: Crew Hasn’t Checked In\n\nWORK BRIEF: \nJust got word that one of the mining teams is unaccounted for. They were supposed to be back hours ago, but no one’s heard from them. Family have tried to reach out but haven’t gotten a response from anyone on the crew.\n\nI can send you their last known location, so we’re looking for someone to go check in and see if they’re okay. If the worst happened, please identify anyone you find. I’m sure the families would appreciate some closure on what happened.\n\nThanks\n\nPAYMENT:\nStandard listed rate upon entire crew's status confirmation.\n\nAUTHORIZATION:\nBattaglia, Recco",
